    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><br>&quot;KARTmania&quot; is a realistic racing kart game.<br>Setting changes such as seat position and sprocket length,<br>Let's capture the circuit course with driving technique!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Play flow</h2><br>There are two modes to choose from: a race mode in which 6 karts compete for ranking, and a time attack mode in which the fastest time is competed.<br>If you win the podium in race mode, the number of courses you can choose for races and time attacks will increase.<br>In time attack mode, you will run alone and aim to update the fastest time, but the current fastest time is<br>Since it is displayed as a ghost, you can enjoy the excitement of the race.<br>You can also see the world ranking on the leaderboard!<br>Change the settings to adjust to the best machine and aim for the fastest time!",
